        "original_id": "26a6314a-0d9d-55c2-9e6f-5c218a8d43e0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Nativity Story, Alien Invasion Arizona, The Salena Incident\n- People: Catherine Hardwicke, Keisha Castle-Hughes, Oscar Isaac\n- Companies: Temple Hill Entertainment, Lionsgate\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Actress, Broadcast Film Critics Association Awards for Best Young Actor/Actress\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Keisha Castle-Hughes won the Broadcast Film Critics Association Award for Best Young Actor/Actress, and her film was also nominated for an Academy Award for Best Actress.\n- In 2006, The Nativity Story was released as a biblical drama film based on the nativity of Jesus.\n- In 2006, The Nativity Story was directed by Catherine Hardwicke and starred Keisha Castle-Hughes and Oscar Isaac.\n- In 2006, Temple Hill Entertainment's first produced film was The Nativity Story, directed by Catherine Hardwicke.\n- Alien Invasion Arizona was also titled The Salena Incident.\n- Alien Invasion Arizona was a straight-to-DVD release produced by Temple Hill Entertainment and distributed by Lionsgate.",
